{title: Neele Gagan Ke Tale}
{artist: Mahendra Kapoor}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] Heey.. Neele gagan ke [Am] tale,        Dharti ka [G] pyaar pale
[G] Aise hi jag mein,        [G] Aati hein subehein
Aise hi [D] shaam [G] dhale,        [G] Shabnam ke moti Phoolon pe bhikhre
[G] Dono ki aas [Am] phale,        [G] Heey.. Neele gagan ke [Am] tale
Dharti ka [G] pyaar pale,        [G] Balkhaati dene Masti mein khele
[G] Pedho se milke [Am] gale,        [G] Heey.. Neele gagan ke [Am] tale
Dharti ka [G] pyaar pale,        [G] Nadiya ka paani Dariya se milke
[G] Saagar ki aor [Am] chale,        [G] Heey.. Neele gagan ke [Am] tale
Dharti ka [G] pyaar pale,        [G] Aise hi jag mein
[G] Aati hein subehein,        Aise hi [D] shaam [G] dhale
